OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be windy with
OL,6,Fscattered showers in the west and the
OL,7,Foccasional bright spell. The showers
OL,8,Fwill die as bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fincrease through the morning. The wind
OL,10,Fwill ease down in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be dry with
OL,13,Fclear spells but cloud will soon
OL,14,Fincrease with rain, some heavy,
OL,15,Ffollowing from the northwest towards
OL,16,Fdawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,19,Fduring the morning. The rain will
OL,20,Fclear during the afternoon with bright
OL,21,Fspells increasing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
